WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.074 --> 00:00:19.227
"What?" the queen shouted at her mirror.

2
00:00:19.228 --> 00:00:23.269
"Who is more beautiful than I am?"

3
00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:28.773
"Snow White, My Lady," the mirror said.

4
00:00:28.774 --> 00:00:32.843
The queen was very angry.

5
00:00:32.844 --> 00:00:37.919
"Everyone says Snow White is so pretty!

6
00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:41.898
She's so nice, so perfect!

7
00:00:41.899 --> 00:00:57.406
Well, they will stop saying it soon!"

8
00:00:57.407 --> 00:01:04.066
That night the queen met a hunter in the village.

9
00:01:04.067 --> 00:01:07.426
He carried an ax.

10
00:01:07.427 --> 00:01:11.148
The queen whispered in his ear.

11
00:01:11.149 --> 00:01:17.879
Then she slipped some gold coins into his hand.

12
00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:22.815
The next day Snow White walked through the village.

13
00:01:22.816 --> 00:01:26.517
A stranger grabbed her.

14
00:01:26.518 --> 00:01:30.337
"Let me go!" Snow White cried.

15
00:01:30.338 --> 00:01:35.210
It was the hunter.

16
00:01:35.211 --> 00:01:38.834
He threw Snow White onto a horse.

17
00:01:38.835 --> 00:01:45.935
"Ya!" he cried as he jumped on.

18
00:01:45.936 --> 00:01:49.191
The horse reached a dark forest.

19
00:01:49.192 --> 00:01:53.313
Snow White saw black, tangled branches.

20
00:01:53.314 --> 00:01:56.574
Then something else caught her eye.

21
00:01:56.575 --> 00:02:00.145
An ax hung from the hunter's belt.

22
00:02:00.146 --> 00:02:03.350
Snow White gulped.

23
00:02:03.351 --> 00:02:05.704
"Please, sir! Let me go!

24
00:02:05.705 --> 00:02:08.487
I haven't done anything wrong!"

25
00:02:08.488 --> 00:02:11.846
Tears slipped down her cheeks.

26
00:02:11.847 --> 00:02:22.909
The hunter sighed and stopped the horse.

27
00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:29.731
"You poor child," he said.

28
00:02:29.732 --> 00:02:33.513
"Go. But don't ever return home.

29
00:02:33.514 --> 00:02:36.214
The queen wants you dead!"

30
00:02:36.215 --> 00:02:40.995
Snow White gasped. "Why?"

31
00:02:40.996 --> 00:02:44.378
"It doesn't matter," the hunter said.

32
00:02:44.379 --> 00:02:50.640
"Just go!"

33
00:02:50.641 --> 00:02:56.187
Snow White disappeared among the trees.

34
00:02:56.188 --> 00:03:00.062
"Poor Snow White," the hunter thought.

35
00:03:00.063 --> 00:03:07.123
"She will never survive in this forest."
